            "city": "Philadelphia, PA",
            "stars": 5
          }
        },
        "testimonial_8NJFdz": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Making new friends in your 30s isn't exactly something that happens every day, but Silly Pickles somehow makes it feel easy. I'm on my 5th season, and I absolutely love it!!!!",
            "name": "- Jess L.",
            "city": "Houston, TX",
            "stars": 5
          }
        },
        "testimonial_3ddzTi": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "NYC is a tough place to meet people. This format's great because you see the same crew every week, and can actually make friends.\"",
